# Keep the Docker build context small.
#
# The frontend source is built in its own Node stage; local dependencies and
# generated bundles are not part of the Docker context. This avoids copying a
# developer's node_modules or Arena preview into the Go image build.

.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
web/frontend/node_modules
web/frontend/dist
web/frontend/preview
web/dist
**/*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
tmp/
temp/
